# Project constitution entry point

Read every project-local constitution article and the active project knowledge
bundle before accepting work. The active project rules override this generic
starter where explicitly documented.

Read the design specification, ordered story backlog, active story, relevant
ADR, feature, QA procedure, and verification commands. Work only in the
assigned git worktree. Commit before handoff and use the structured handoff
helper.
